            <title>1.5.8</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 19:29:26 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>40</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Copy Path keyboard shortcut and menu item.</b> Copy Path is now in the Edit menu (in its own section below Move to Trash, matching the right-click menu) with a <b>⌥⌘C</b> shortcut, like Finder's "Copy as Pathname". Previously it lived only in the right-click menu, so the shortcut was neither discoverable nor available. It copies the selected items' paths in both the file list and the gallery view.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
